//RS //! Rust source emission for optimized canonical MIR.
//RS //!
//RS //! This module is deliberately a printer, not a second lowering pipeline.  It
//RS //! consumes the checked `MirProgram` rows and emits Rust items and a small CFG
//RS //! machine.  Names, calls, ownership, failure edges, and target facts come from
//RS //! MIR; the narrow Core path ABI adapter only projects canonical sema signature
//RS //! metadata and performs no ad-hoc source or Core-name lookup.
//RS 
